You're ready for Gehennom, you'll just want to improve things some
before waking Rodney.  But you have a ways to go.  Make sure you have
a reliable way of curing sickness.

Also make sure you remember that you have Magicbane and can 1-turn E
if needed, and remember you have the Eye to get out of Dodge.  Should
be fairly safe without those, and you have the "oLS if things get
truly nasty, but they are good ways to avoid the "oLS and stay alive.

> All c's genocided long time ago (took on both Fort
> Ludios and Castle with no rubber chicken), while mind flayers are not.

L and mind flayers are generally much more important genocides than
c.  c are very useful and if you're careful not really dangerous
(always have an uncursed or blessed  lizard corpse in main inventory).

For a wizard especially, h can be horrible.  Avoid travel commands and
keep your guard up.

