> No-teleport
> level, and Eye of Aethiopica is in the bag

Keep the Eye in main inventory at all times.

> Put on Eye of Tapioca and transport to Fort Ludios.

You don't need to be wearing it to #invoke it--the only thing wearing
it buys you is ESP.  But just carrying it in open inventory gives you
PW regeneration and MR, and you can #invoke it to airlift to relative
safety.



